{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/t7mwfw","slideIndex":0,"text":"Sources: Figure 10, assets/human-practices/images/shahe-volunteer-activity-coordination-notes.png; Figure 22, assets/human-practices/images/shahe-needs-assessment-and-workbook-feedback.png. These are synthesized team interview/fieldwork summaries, not verbatim quotations or population-wide findings. Time constraints and staff coordination: Figure 10 staff interview panel and Figure 22 care difficulties panel. Trust and participation: Figure 10 willingness panel, Figure 22 trust and health-related participation panel. Group before individual, advance questions and adapting to health: Figure 10. Caregiver viewpoint is an editorial grouping of those source points. The first source also suggests about two days between visits; this operational detail is omitted to keep the main map short."}
